Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 15:14:42 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 10/53] Debug: --title_input_script scripted controller for
 titles

Presses for player 1 ("down,a,wait2000,b,...") as button state and as
VK_PAD keystrokes (XUI titles like the dashboard read keystrokes), each
logged with the wall-clock time, for testing without a controller.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AFb8CDFE1Ms5NnJH88eG8b
